 * Skybox vertex projection adapted from Cocos Creator 3.8.8 pipeline/skybox.effect.
 * Source: https://github.com/cocos/cocos-engine/blob/411f98df047c25902f93440d4b22925c2fb65461/editor/assets/effects/pipeline/skybox.effect
